WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.770
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:34.270
A woman's face changes from day to night.

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:38.490
Make-up is applied lightly, with elegance 
during the day so it does not crack.

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.780
And at night?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.240
It is done stylishly and alluringly.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.500
Try not to make such an unattractive noises.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.350
Especially from such cherry-red lips.

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:55.510
Behold. You are truly a vision this evening.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:00.500
This is me?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.810
You refer to guests as "sir."

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.520
Other geisha are "onee-san."

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.430
You keep smiling even at 
unfavorable guests and say...

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:12.450
My, what a terrible jokester you are!

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.410
Hey, why do I have to do this?

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.120
You look adorable, Kyoka-san!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:21.510
Well now, you've made quite 
an incredible transformation.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:24.260
I'll have to make sure not to be outdone.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:25.960
Stop messing around!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.690
I can't do this! There's no way!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:29.980
I can't be some working geisha girl!

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:31.190
Then pay me for the tatami mats.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:37.180
Well, it's only for tonight, so let's both 
do our best to get through it together.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:41.290
She's right. And besides, all the guests 
that will be there tonight are rich,

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:45.550
so if everything goes well, we might 
get paid extra on top of our usual fee.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:48.330
Do you ever think about 
anything besides money?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.150
They do say that money opens all doors.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.710
In this day and age, being without 
money is like being without your head.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.330
You said the guests would be rich...

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.070
What kind of people will be attending 
the festivities this evening?

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.520
This event is called a popular party,

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.740
which is a banquet for all the important
 people who support Japan.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.450
What? They're really that important?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.700
Oh, no, now I'm getting nervous.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.120
Don't look so glum, silly.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.850
You are my number one student,

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:18.430
so just hold your head high and stand tall.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.780
But what if I mess something up?

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:24.460
You don't need to worry. I will be watching 
over you closely the entire time.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:26.070
That's reassuring.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.240
You're not only beautiful, but you 
have such a big heart, Otoyakko-san!

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.220
Isn't she just the most 
amazing woman, Kyoka-san?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.740
Some woman, indeed.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.230
Now then, it is time we were on our way.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.810
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.750
<b>Electricity of Dreams and Passion</b>

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.750
Hey! We're out of sake!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.950
All right, be right with you!

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:03.720
Now then, get to work, you two.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.760
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:09.010
Unbelievable!

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.680
I know that voice...

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:16.030
I wondered who this beautiful geisha 
girl might be, and it's you, Mei-san.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.820
I thought it was you, Yakumo-san!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.790
What are you doing here?

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.000
I should be the one asking you that!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.280
Why are you here? Are you 
working as a waitress?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.030
S-Sure, something like that.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.120
I see, I see!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.020
Either way, you look so beautiful!

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.200
I truly envy Mori-san!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.540
What was that about Ougai-san?

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.030
You're here too, Syunso-san?!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.310
If Syunso-san is here, that means...

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:48.550
You don't need to wonder. 
Ougai-san is on his way here now.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:52.790
Why are you here, and why are you
dressed up like that, anyway?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.600
Well, about that... 
Things are kind of complicated...

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.600
Hum, hum.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.050
Am I, Lafcadio, the only one hum-humming?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.010
So this is a job you're keeping
 secret from Mori-san.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.710
Okay. I will help you when the time comes.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.480
T-Thank you so much!

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:12.530
Hey! Hurry up and bring more warm sake!

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:13.210
Yes, sir!

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:14.980
I'm so sorry. I'll be going now.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.330
Hum, hum?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:22.680
It's so crowded in there, 
and since I look so different, I'll be able

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.590
to get away without running 
into Ougai-san if I'm lucky.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.580
Please pardon me.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.860
<i>I spoke too soon!</i>

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:34.960
Well now, I thought I heard 
you out here, Mori-sensei.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:39.140
Why, if it isn't Otoyakko,
 the most famous geisha in Kagurazaka.

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:42.870
How can you be so formal?
It's not like we're strangers.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.350
You haven't changed a bit.

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:48.620
Don't you mean to say I'm 
as beautiful as ever?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.090
<i>They know each other?</i>

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.380
Is your apprentice there a new addition?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:55.460
How astute you are. 
She is merely in training.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.880
She has struggled her way here 
fresh from the countryside.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.380
Oh?

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.620
She is a rather lovely girl.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.430
She has been coming to me 
to learn proper etiquette,

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.470
so she won't disgrace
the man she cares about.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.130
Isn't it the sweetest thing?

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.380
Proper etiquette?

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.140
You there, don't just stand 
there all day. Go back inside.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.310
Your guests are waiting.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:21.150
Y-Yes, Onee-san. Please excuse me, sir!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.970
She truly is a wonderful young woman.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.040
Isn't she?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:29.780
So, are you eventually planning to keep 
her close as an apprentice geisha?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.390
Huh?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:34.900
You had her come to this party so that you 
could assess her suitability, correct?

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:37.460
You are a cunning man.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:41.920
Frankly, I hadn't thought that far ahead, 
but I wouldn't mind if it happened.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.170
I see.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:49.710
I can't let a special girl like that go
to waste on a fine man like yourself.

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.920
With proper refining, she 
could be a shining jewel.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.570
Do you mean to steal her from me?

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.540
That might be entertaining as well.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.020
Who is the cunning one now?

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:04.270
Hey, I'm out of sake!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.950
Me, too!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.630
Yes, sir!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.340
No matter how many bottles 
I bring them, it's never enough.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.460
How much can these men drink?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:15.580
Woman! Come, sit on my lap and serve me!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.330
Umm, umm, umm...

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.940
My, what a terrible jokester you are!

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:22.460
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.450
H-Huh?

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.710
Why do you keep running away?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.130
Come on, come over here!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.470
No, don't touch me!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:29.580
Sir!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.720
What do you want?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.220
You mustn't sexually harass people.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.530
S-Sexual harassment?

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.310
Allow me to explain!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.020
Sexual harassment is a term which refers to

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.930
extremely ungentlemanly, 
disgraceful behavior.

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:48.650
Proper ladies and gentlemen should 
not partake of such behavior.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.480
Okay, got it.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.760
Thank you so much, Yakumo-san.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:56.670
The geisha here today are 
especially excellent.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.890
How would you two like to 
do things with me tonight?

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.990
T-Tonight? Now, wait just a minute...

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:05.610
You there! Please tell 
me what's in this dish.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.930
Syunso-san?

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:09.320
Y-Yes, right away.

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.550
Pardon me, sir.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.370
This dish?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.420
I don't actually care about the dish.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.030
Anyway, you shouldn't get too 
close to the drunk ones.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.530
Thank you for getting me out of there.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.600
Left to your own devices,

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.530
you'd make a careless mistake 
with someone important.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:33.180
Eh, that man is someone important?

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.370
They all are.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.620
Huh. They all just seem like 
drunk old men to me.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.460
Kyoka-san's been caught again!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:47.070
Do you really need to take 
care of him so much?

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.670
Izumi is a man, so he'll be fine.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.640
But Kyoka-san is a germophobe.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.670
It has nothing to do with 
being a man or a woman.

00:08:58.110 --> 00:09:01.810
Why do you try so hard for everyone?

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.760
Touching is not allowed, sir!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.790
Shut up! Butts exist to be touched!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.990
That's absurd!

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:14.380
But, you see, umm... she... 
yes! She is betrothed!

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.680
Being betrothed is the 
same as having a fiancée,

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.430
which is also the same as an intended.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:19.420
Okay, okay?

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.160
Intended   Fiancée   Betrothed

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.420
They all mean the same thing!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:24.710
Betrothed? Just break it off or something!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.390
What an awful thing to say!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.600
I am of an age where I am 
sensitive to words like "fiancée"!

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:34.080
Don't think you're going to get away 
with speaking to me like that!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.260
I can't do this anymore...

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.710
Insisting that I break things off
would only be appropiate if I were a geisha.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.340
And I'm not even a woman,
let alone a geisha,

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.230
so you might as well just tell me to die!

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.790
I've had enough!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.400
P-Perhaps I've had too much to drink.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.990
Now then, one and all,

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.490
Shokyokusai Ten'ichi would 
like a moment of your time.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.490
Huh?

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.250
<i>Where have I seen him before?</i>

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:19.390
I would like to sincerely thank 
you for listening to my wishes

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:23.640
and holding a special popular party today.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:26.500
Who is that?

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.580
That is Iwasaki Tosuke,

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:35.390
a famous investor and the foremost figure 
in electrical generator research.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:38.440
Electrical generator? 
That means electricity, right?

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.150
I had no idea there was someone 
like that in this time.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.210
Before I make my argument,

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.790
please enjoy a performance by 
the greatest magician of the age.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.620
Wait, is that Charlie-san?

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.340
Impressive.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.670
You startled us.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.800
What do you mean?

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.650
When it comes to negotiating, giving
the other party something first

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.810
makes them feel that they, too, 
have to give something back.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.290
That man, Tosuke,

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:11.800
will likely get down to business after 
everyone has enjoyed themselves to the fullest.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:14.800
In other words, he's a pretty shrewd person.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.440
Now, for all those present,

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:20.830
in a great magical transcendence 
of time and space,

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:24.680
I will bring forth here 
a profoundly mysterious creature

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:27.590
from the far southern reaches of Egypt!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.950
Laura-chan, the Bactrian 
camel, makes her debut!

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.160
This is absolutely splendid.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.540
Ougai-san!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.600
W-Wait, Ou—

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:54.550
There is debate about whether their 
humps are filled with water or fat.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.930
I would like to touch them to be sure.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:00.690
B-Be careful, Ougai-sa— I mean, sir!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.700
What for? This creature has surprisingly 
gentle features, does it not?

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.950
Ougai-san!

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:20.170
Oops. I guess I made her angry?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.450
She's usually gentle, though.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.540
I can relate. Being touched is a pain.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.850
How can you be so calm right now?!

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.700
One must never underestimate 
wild animals, I guess.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.540
Hey now, Charlie-san!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.670
I once brought out an Indian 
elephant, and it almost trampled me.

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.190
I'll have to be more careful next time.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.580
I want to trample you right now!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.070
Eh, what for? As a reward?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.070
Why are you happy about that? You pervert!

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:50.830
Based on your appearance, you seem 
to be fully enjoying this time period.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.280
That's not the issue right now!

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:57.590
Sorry, but just be a bit more 
patient until the full moon.

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:00.850
Until the full moon?

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:04.330
I know. You wish to get
back sooner, don't you?

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:07.470
No, I'm all right.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.860
I can wait that long.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.860
What? He's gone?

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:14.270
Huh? And the room's cleaned up...

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.710
Fukuzawa Yukichi-sensei has arrived.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.160
Be at ease everyone.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:24.610
Wait, Fukuzawa Yukichi? The guy 
on the 10,000 yen bill?!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.550
You there, young lady.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:29.110
Would you mind also getting 
this man something to drink?

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.500
No need.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.610
I am serving as your 
bodyguard at the moment.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.610
Fujita-san!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:36.770
You are...?

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.370
Welcome.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.370
Thank you very much for coming, 
Fukuzawa-sensei.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:48.080
I came to listen to your important speech,
that concerns the future of Japan.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.330
Much obliged.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:53.880
Iwasaki, is your nonsense 
worth listening to?

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.730
It is not nonsense.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:59.220
Electricity is vital to Japan if we are 
to be equals to various countries

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.250
of Europe and America,
instead of being outdone.

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:06.330
Furthermore, it is a well-known fact 
that existing gas lamps have problems

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:10.040
such as concerns of explosions and of 
poisoning from insufficient ventilation,

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.400
as well as depletion of fuel.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.900
Are you saying that electricity 
doesn't have those issues?

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:16.280
Have you forgotten about 
those who were gravely injured

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.670
because of an electric light 
you installed as an experiment?

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.660
Eh? People were injured?

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:24.930
That is because one of the curious onlookers 
inadvertently touched the wire.

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:26.300
So you say,

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:29.810
but even the sparrows and crows who 
perched on the wire were not unharmed!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:32.990
Electricity is the devil's light! 
It only curses and kills human!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.530
That's right, that's right!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:37.940
The devil's light? Electricity is a curse?

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.640
Utterly absurd.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:43.360
I cannot believe these are the opinions of 
any self-respecting, knowledgeable person.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.930
Mentioning things like curses 
in this age of enlightenment...

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.450
What do you know!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:51.420
Besides, the lamplighters who light the gas 
lamps are respected by the general public.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.900
Are you going to take away 
that honorable position?

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.950
And most importantly,

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.360
regarding fuel, the cost
of electricity stands out.

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:01.790
That is why I am here 
asking for investments.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.980
I would like you to understand 
that it is necessary for us

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:09.180
to fund the electrical power business in 
order for Japan to overtake other countries.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.570
Don't be ridiculous.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:12.960
We have more than enough lights already!

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:16.680
No, they are not enough to 
light the future of Japan.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.970
Fukuzawa-sensei, please state your decision.

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:23.470
Even though he worked so hard...

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:24.920
Fukuzawa-sensei...

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.980
Knock it off, Iwasaki! 
Your behavior is unsightly.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.540
Yes, he's right!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.730
Electricity is nothing more 
than your silly dream!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.060
That's right, that's right!

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.730
Hey, woman, what are you doing?

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:36.980
It is not just a silly dream!

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:47.270
Things would be really wonderful 
if we had electricity!

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.140
It is a truly amazing thing!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.390
Her lack of vocabulary leaves 
a lot to be desired.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.390
I mean, with electricity, there are 
so many possibilities!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:16:01.590
You can completely transform a dark and 
gloomy night bright as day right in a flash!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.270
Halt!

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:10.590
You can easily clean the house without 
back pain by just pressing a button!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:15.990
A shower will always be hot whether 
it's spring, summer, fall, or winter!

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.820
La, la, la, la!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.670
You can talk with someone 
face-to-face even from far away!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.280
Hello there, oh my fair lady!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:32.100
You can make any changes you like, as 
often as you like, to electric drawings!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.320
Art is an explosion!

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:41.610
There's absolutely no worry about fires, and 
there's cooking food, and sterilization!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:45.310
No more germs! What a great world this is!

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:48.670
La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la,

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.900
Do all your massages and
beauty routines at home!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.500
This is so nice, this is so nice!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:01.030
You can travel all over Japan as much as 
you want with a limited express train!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.830
Yay!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:07.160
Turn on the air conditioner, and it cools 
in the summer and warms in the winter!

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.070
Feels so nice!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:15.540
Anything and everything is at your fingertips!
All you have to do is press a button!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.400
Electricity is magical, tap-tap-tap!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:21.320
The thing that makes everyone's life easier,

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.220
that would be, that would be,
 that would be!

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:27.070
Electricity, electricity, 
electricity, electricity!

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.760
What is a friend to us humans?

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:32.730
Electricity, electricity, 
electricity, electricity!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.520
The future must be a bright one!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:38.410
You can do anything with electricity!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.130
Now, now, everybody sing it with me!

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:41.990
One!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:42.670
Two!

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.030
Three!

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.990
Electricity is king!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:54.870
Wonderful.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.840
He who will not advance will fall behind,

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.130
and he who will not fall 
behind will surely advance.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.970
Iwasaki-kun, I would be 
happy to work with you.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.410
Thank you so much, Fukuzawa-sensei.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:09.130
Now, let's make a night of it!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:11.350
I thought it might come to that!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.120
Ladies, make sure to work hard 
and give them plenty to drink!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.780
Bring out the Denki Bran!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.150
Okay!

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.900
I'm really tired all of a sudden.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:28.140
The electrical power business might actually 
be able to continue, thanks to you.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.650
I am truly grateful.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:33.910
Oh, no, I just thought it would 
be nice if we had electricity.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:37.600
I had only thought about 
lighting things up at night.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:42.260
But it is wonderful that you were 
able to think about how it might play

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.920
into all aspects of people's lives.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.690
Not at all. Lighting things up 
is the most important part.

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:51.560
What a mysterious person you are.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.460
If I had a woman like you by my side,

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:57.660
I would be able to keep dreaming 
well into the future.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:02.770
Intelligent young lady, I would like 
to acquire all the knowledge you have.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.440
Mei, may I have a moment?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.670
Of course.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:18.340
Pardon me... Tosuke-san, 
was it? I must be going.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.110
I cannot believe such a 
woman exists in this time.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.320
Has he figured it out?

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:31.470
Hey, wait, you!

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:33.960
What is it?

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.320
Ah, nothing.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:40.350
I was deeply moved by the splendidness 
of electricity, Iwasaki-san!

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.490
Oh, thank you.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:46.490
With electricity, I will be able to call 
my best friend Fujita-san all the time.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.650
I am so emotional about it, 
I cannot stop my tears.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.910
He's a weepy drunk?

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.860
Who are you calling your best friend?

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:54.400
I don't mind a man like that.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:55.150
Huh?

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.590
You there, do something about this drunkard.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.710
Excuse me? You're awfully cocky for a cop.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:00.870
Unhand me.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:05.140
I'm going to melt that stubbornness 
out of you today, so get ready!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.260
Stop it!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:10.050
They're totally drunk, too.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:11.760
They did drink quite a bit...

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.500
Is it hard for you to be in the mansion?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:21.220
Eh?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.880
It seems I placed quite a heavy burden on you,

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:27.780
just by calling you my fiancée.

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.700
That led you to find a 
place here to devote yourself

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.740
to studying the manners 
and etiquette of a lady.

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.900
And to Kawakami-kun.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.290
Kawakami-kun?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:43.790
Otoyakko is Kawakami Otojiro-kun.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:48.300
Huh? Otoyakko-san is O-Otojiro-san?!

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:50.380
You didn't know?

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.460
Really?

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:54.800
So I cooked that mochi for nothing.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.020
Mochi?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.190
Oh, nevermind.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.530
It was quite unlike me, 
but I was a bit concerned

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.410
you might have been taken away.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.060
Huh?

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:05.910
You really have no idea, 
do you, Little Squirrel?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.810
Just how much power you have 
to charm those around you.

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:16.580
I just wanted to find 
a way to thank you.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.760
Thank me?

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.750
You saved me at the 
Rokumeikan and let me stay

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:24.720
in your home despite 
having lost my memories.

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:29.970
Mei...

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:32.970
Stay with me.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.600
Ougai-san?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.300
Stay in my mansion forever.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.580
I want to.

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.230
I want to stay there forever.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.300
Then stay. Stay as long as you like.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:48.480
Be it a year or even ten years.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:50.780
All right.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:02.490
Let's go eat the cutlet at 
Rengatei, then go home.

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:04.870
Okay.

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.050
Come on now!

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:12.450
When you're drunk, it doesn't matter 
if you're with a man or a woman!

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:13.000
I agree.

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:16.680
I'm going to kill you here, whether 
you're a man or a woman.

00:22:17.550 --> 00:22:21.660
Pwease stop fighting over me!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Meiji Tokyo Renka</b>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
Next Episode Preview

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.970
I Miss You Dearly, Rainy Day

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:31.720
<b>Bell</b>

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:33.510
Come back, Shirayuki.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:37.070
If I can't have that,

00:23:37.070 --> 00:23:39.650
I'm going to end it here and now!
